END-STATE: WHAT "DONE" LOOKS LIKE
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Bus Route (Complete Flow):
  BASKET → POST /api/checkout → STRIPE EMBEDDED → WEBHOOK → SANITY ORDER → RETURN PAGE

Bus Stop Expectations:
  Stop 1: Basket has items, checkout enabled gate works
  Stop 2: Layout fetches user/guest address, provides to context
  Stop 3: Address validated via Google API, format mapped correctly
  Stop 4: Stock reserved (not decremented), Stripe session created, client_secret returned
  Stop 5: Stripe Embedded Checkout renders with payment form
  Stop 6: Webhook receives event, verifies signature, creates order, finalizes stock
  Stop 7: Return page fetches order from Sanity by session ID, shows confirmation
  Stop 8: All failure paths handled — rollback reservations, show user-friendly errors

