       — Maps Stripe line items to OrderItem format
       — Sets payment.stripeCheckoutSessionId
       — Sets status: "processing"
       — Sets dates.orderedAt and dates.paidAt
    7. Finalizes stock: for each product, dec({ stock: qty, reservedStock: qty })
    8. Returns 200

